      "BR1G KD11 is a printed right-side delay input driven by BP.D09; its K occupies the border cell, D11 remains adjacent. Physical geometry stays right-side while semantic_direction=input validates ownership. Numeric pin qualifiers 2,3,4,6 and inline 6 before BX are literal source text; D02T retains suffix T.",
